              "doc_version": "0cc02e6531d6",
              "chunk_id": "rv-0147",
              "snippet": "Remove the dirty water reservoir and check if the roller is entangled with foreign objects---especially strings, data cables, plastic bags, hair, etc. Clean out any debris to ensure the roller rotates properly. (Note:Please refer the video below. If you hear a clicking sound, it indicates that the roller is properly installed.)",
              "score": 1.0,
              "status": "ok"
            }
          ]
        },
